  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:172px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/GOS_Franchise.PNG\" title=\"Guild of Shadows Franchise Operator\"><img alt=\"Guild of Shadows Franchise Operator\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"191\" src=\"/images/GOS_Franchise.PNG\" width=\"170\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/GOS_Franchise.PNG\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Guild of Shadows Franchise Operator</div></div></div>\n<p>The Guild of Shadows Franchise Operator is an oversized <a href=\"/wiki/Embercore_Angel\" title=\"Embercore Angel\">Embercore Angel</a> Champion found in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">The Embercore Path</a> Level 6.  She is the object of the Quest <a href=\"/wiki/King's_Hit_List_Part_7\" title=\"King's Hit List Part 7\">King's Hit List Part 7</a> given by <a href=\"/wiki/Sir_Ving_N'Seacressy\" title=\"Sir Ving N'Seacressy\">Sir Ving N'Seacressy</a>. She's surrounded by a large mob of <a href=\"/wiki/Embercore_Felknight\" title=\"Embercore Felknight\">Embercore Felknights</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Embercore_Prophetess\" title=\"Embercore Prophetess\">Embercore Prophetesses</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/GoS_Guards\" title=\"GoS Guards\">GoS Guards</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
